     ],
     "value": "Regulates intracellular concentrations of taurine and glutamate. Negatively modulates SLC1A1/EAAC1 glutamate transport activity by decreasing its affinity for glutamate in a PKC activity-dependent manner. Plays a role in the retention of SLC1A1/EAAC1 in the endoplasmic reticulum"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
