       "source": "UniProtKB",
       "id": "Q9ES40"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Homodimer. Heterodimer with ARL6IP1. Forms multimers. Interacts with ARL6. Interacts with prenylated RAB1A and RAB3A. Interacts with SLC1A1/EAAC1. Interacts with RTN2 (via first transmembrane domain). Does not interact with VAMP1, VAMP2 or VAMP3"
    }
